type: software
title: "InferCell.jl"
abstract: >-
  Composable, inference-first whole-cell modelling in Julia: a compositional
  inference framework, demonstrated on a reduced JCVI-syn3A model, with exact
  stochastic and mean-field descriptions across a coupled ODE-jump boundary.
